  X ≡ ad (mu (mu c c) d) S
sy-qalg A z ad mu L c d X a1 a2 a3 a4 a5 a6 rr a7 ru uq S h1 h2 h3 h4 h5 h6 h7 h8 h9 h10 h11 = cl-tr A X (ad (mu c (ad a7 ru)) (ad (mu c uq) S)) (ad (mu (mu c c) d) S)
